  "purpose": "DEC-054 golden for V2-M5b (DEC-066): the size test of a synthetic company over four framework years (2024, 2025, 2026 and a six-month 2027) under two verified synthetic threshold sets. It shows the two-or-more-of-three conditions, the two-consecutive-years rule carrying a status forward, the earliest year resting on the preparer's facts, a transitional rule that tests the preceding year against the new set, a short year whose turnover limit is adjusted, other income left out of turnover, and closed years giving the same figures. Every figure, condition and result was written by hand before the code.",
